{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S08至S12这些停留较短的段落里，感受提示仍然偏密，尤其S09把“怕孤单”进一步解释成愿意重新忍受委屈，比X更替人物下了判断。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"平\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用加亮的关键词让人不用读完每句话就能抓住人物当下的处境，感受又有大小层级和出现时点，比较容易边听边扫。它对钢琴音色、节奏、力度、旋律回归和情绪转折的描写也更具体，使人物的心理变化不只是抽象情绪标签；反复出现的“当作自己人”则强化了全曲的内在联系。X的优势是叙述完整、因果句读起来更自然，但整体上对音乐细节和情绪微妙变化的呈现不如Y丰富。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "cf00381d-eafd-4880-bc46-85fbc2b09ac3", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T182028635563Z", "elapsed_seconds": 129.063, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T18:22:37.694377+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "25dcb974d3d3d0fec71405bc219c320550b1cb39659dcf597d3867003f98157c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_